WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:15,130
Should liposomal glutathione be taken with a meal with fat in it for better

00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:22,090
absorption? No, you can take it any time. It is a liposomal, so by definition

00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:27,930
liposomal nutrients are wrapped in a fat, so you don't need to take it with a

00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:32,970
fatty meal to absorb it. Plus it's very small, you don't really need a lot of

00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:38,650
bile to help absorb it either. You have enough already that got even for those

00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:45,210
without a gold ladder and you'll secrete lipase from your papers as well.

